  "result_event": 426,
  "issue": "ENG-2439",
  "body": "Line differs from the notices. SVB Payment Processed notices add up to $374,654.00 over 29 wires. Leapblock closed our file on Feb 13 (#leapblock in Slack) and reported $407,944 received over 30 wires. The extra wire is the Sep 13, 2023 one for $33,290: it has an \"awaiting approval\" notice from SVB but no \"processed\" notice. Per the counting note, their close-out beats the notices, so I'm using $407,944. The $33,290 is dated Sep 13, 2023, so it goes to Domino Delights. Line: DD $337,594 / ZM $59,250 / CF $11,100. Build."
 },
